<VI _name="RemoteVI Window Rows.vi" description="The windows RemoteVI Server offers to share\2C grouped and sorted\2C from the top-level windows RemoteVI List Top Windows.vi read. Kept\3A visible\2C at least 100 x 50 pixels\2C with a caption\2C not a tool window (WS_EX_TOOLWINDOW) nor one that cannot be activated (WS_EX_NOACTIVATE)\2C not a shell window (classes Windows.UI.Core.CoreWindow\2C Windows.Internal.Shell.TabProxyWindow\2C Progman\2C LockScreenBackstopFrame)\3B a LabVIEW window (class LVDChild) also when it is owned (LabVIEW's panels are owned by its hidden frame window)\2C other windows only when they are not owned (no dialogs)\3B no LabVIEW window whose caption names a Block Diagram or Project Explorer\3B not the window skip (the app's own). group 0 = LabVIEW (the development environment\2C LabVIEW.exe)\2C 1 = a LabVIEW-built application (a LabVIEW window of another program)\2C 2 = other programs\3B labview only? keeps groups 0 and 1. Sorted by group\2C program name (case-insensitive) and caption. Pure function\2C cannot fail. Reference\3A windowRows() in tools\5Clib\5Cserver-app.mjs\2C vectors tests\5Cvectors\5Cserver-app.json.">
